Homepage Helm Config Notes
==========================

Values file: ~/homepage-values.yaml
Helm repo:   jameswynn
Chart:       homepage (v2.1.0, app v1.2.0)
Namespace:   prod

Deploy command:
  helm upgrade homepage jameswynn/homepage -n prod -f ~/homepage-values.yaml

Config keys under the `config:` section:

  config.settings   → settings.yaml   (theme, color, title, layout, etc.)
  config.bookmarks  → bookmarks.yaml  (bookmark groups)
  config.services   → services.yaml   (service groups/links)
  config.widgets    → widgets.yaml    (resource/search/K8s widgets)
  config.kubernetes → kubernetes.yaml (K8s integration)
  config.docker     → docker.yaml     (Docker integration)

Important notes:
  - settings.yaml changes (color, theme, title, layout) require clicking
    the refresh icon (bottom-right) in the homepage UI to take effect.
  - bookmarks, services, widgets, kubernetes, docker pick up automatically
    on pod restart.
  - Dark Reader browser extension overrides homepage colors — disable it
    for the homepage domain.
